sequenceDiagram
    participant DSP as Data Science Pipelines<br/>(Pipeline Component)
    participant MLMD as metadata_store_server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP

    Note over DSP,PG: Flow 1: Pipeline Metadata Recording

    DSP->>MLMD: PutExecution (gRPC)<br/>Optional TLS, No App Auth
    MLMD->>PG: INSERT execution, artifacts, events<br/>Optional SSL, Username/Password
    PG-->>MLMD: Rows inserted
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutExecutionResponse

    DSP->>MLMD: PutArtifacts (gRPC)<br/>Datasets, Models, Metrics
    MLMD->>PG: INSERT artifacts
    PG-->>MLMD: Rows inserted
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutArtifactsResponse

    DSP->>MLMD: PutEvents (gRPC)<br/>Link Artifacts to Executions
    MLMD->>PG: INSERT events
    PG-->>MLMD: Rows inserted
    MLMD-->>DSP: PutEventsResponse

    participant UI as Pipeline UI<br/>(API Client)

    Note over UI,PG: Flow 2: Lineage Query

    UI->>MLMD: GetLineageSubgraph (gRPC)<br/>Optional TLS, No App Auth
    MLMD->>PG: SELECT with graph traversal<br/>Optional SSL, Username/Password
    PG-->>MLMD: Lineage graph data
    MLMD-->>UI: LineageSubgraph Response<br/>(Artifacts, Executions, Contexts, Events)
